  "prefLabel": "Plc 1204.06 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1204.06 Withdrawal of Application for Initial Licensure.\n\n(a) An applicant may withdraw an application for licensure at any time prior to being notified of a decision under Plc 1204.07 by proceeding in accordance with Plc 304.07.\n\n(b) If the application is withdrawn, the application processing and licensing fee shall not be refunded.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1200.html"
}
